1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,680
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,520
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,960
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,680
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,280
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:13,560
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,320
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,040
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,680
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,360
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,040
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,720
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:27,240
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,320
=Episode 7=

17
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,120
I'll walk you up.

18
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,120
No need.

19
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:18,799
How long are you going to keep this up?

20
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:20,799
What else do you want from me?

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,319
I played along enough for you tonight.

22
00:01:23,359 --> 00:01:24,680
I never asked you to.

23
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,799
And I won't play along

24
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,239
just to keep up appearances.

25
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,640
That boy toy of yours

26
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,400
chose Ge Yao right in front of you.

27
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,760
Don't you get it?

28
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,519
How charming do you think you are?

29
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,879
Younger guys only want your money.

30
00:01:38,879 --> 00:01:40,280
Older guys just see you as damaged.

31
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,239
I'm sorry.

32
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,760
I take back that last part.

33
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:52,480
What I mean is...

34
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,359
Every slip of the tongue

35
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,400
reveals what you really think.

36
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,079
Duan Cizhou.

37
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,959
You're the one with a filthy mind.

38
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,960
Any man I can't keep,

39
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,400
I don't want.

40
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,120
It's me.

41
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,680
Su Yan.

42
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:32,680
I'm sorry, Su Yan.

43
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,000
Cheng Lin.

44
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,560
I hate the word sorry.

45
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,280
Leave.

46
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,080
Go find your new owner.

47
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:47,639
Su Yan.

48
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,719
Cheng Lin.

49
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,120
Let go of me.

50
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:49,439
Su Yan.

51
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:51,159
I ran three blocks to get here.

52
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,520
I was afraid I'd be too late. I...

53
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,599
Su Yan.

54
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:58,039
Y-you didn't bring him up here.

55
00:02:58,639 --> 00:02:59,560
You two didn't get back together.

56
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,560
Su Yan.

57
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:02,639
I'm sorry.

58
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,879
I lost my head tonight.

59
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:05,479
I don't even know

60
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,400
why I acted like that.

61
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,159
I...

62
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,759
I promise I won't do it again.

63
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:11,599
Please don't push me away.

64
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:13,639
Su Yan.

65
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,840
Please don't push me away.

66
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:16,759
Su Yan.

67
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,680
I don't know why

68
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,639
I acted like that tonight.

69
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,360
Maybe I just like you too much.

70
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,719
Please don't push me away.

71
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,240
What are you after?

72
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:27,960
My success?

73
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:29,520
My money?

74
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:33,800
What do you see in me?

75
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:35,919
You're handsome and young.
That's all I'm after.

76
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:39,000
I just got out of a failed relationship.

77
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:40,800
I don't love you.

78
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,360
So,

79
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,719
if you want someone else, go ahead.

80
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,319
Just leave me alone.

81
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,560
I was just jealous.

82
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,080
I thought you two got back together.

83
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,080
S-Su Yan.

84
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,039
Can't I be the only one you want?

85
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:57,560
♪Some love is still there♪

86
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,240
♪But I can't put it into words♪

87
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:03,320
♪Those who love deeply never change♪

88
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,600
♪It's hard to let go♪

89
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,240
♪Still, I leave you♪

90
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:08,560
Then remember this.

91
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,800
When I don't need you,

92
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:14,080
don't cling to me.

93
00:04:15,479 --> 00:04:16,480
Can you do that?

94
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,439
Mm.

95
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,720
♪With memories overflowing♪

96
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:25,880
♪How am I supposed to move on?♪

97
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,840
♪I'm still the one left behind♪

98
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,760
♪Never once did I♪

99
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,600
♪Run straight into love♪

100
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:34,120
♪I still wasn't the one you chose♪

101
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:41,000
♪You can ignore my devotion♪

102
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,400
(Su Yan.)

103
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:47,000
(Tell me.)

104
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,760
(What would make you feel better?)

105
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,320
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

106
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:56,040
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

107
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:59,480
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

108
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:04,520
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

109
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:21,760
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

110
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:25,360
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

111
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:28,760
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

112
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:32,440
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

113
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:35,840
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

114
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:39,520
♪I hum this song alone♪

115
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:43,120
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

116
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:47,040
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

117
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:50,480
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

118
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:54,160
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

119
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:57,640
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

120
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:02,840
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
